            <description><![CDATA[<h2>FITS n' Finish 0.4.3</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>macOS Location prompt &amp; entitlements.</b> Embedded location entitlements into the signed Developer ID app bundle, added all location description keys to Info.plist, and ignored transient location acquisition errors to allow the macOS system authorization dialog to display.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
