            <description><![CDATA[<h2>FITS n' Finish 0.4.1</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>CoreLocation authorization on macOS.</b> Fixed an issue where clicking "Use live telemetry" on macOS failed to request location permissions, leaving coordinates at zero. Added macOS CoreLocation authorization handling and location entitlements.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
